---
// トップページ：お問い合わせへの誘導
---
<section class="contact-strip">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>話を聞かせてください。</h2>
    <div class="links">
      <button class="button" data-open="contact">お問い合わせ・ご意見 <span>→</span></button>
      <a class="sub-link" href="/supporters/">後援会への入会申し込みはこちら →</a>
    </div>
    <p class="hand">小さな声から、<br />大きな一歩へ。</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
.contact-strip {
  background: linear-gradient(110deg, #e1ebd8, #f2f5e9, #dce8d3);
  padding: calc(var(--section-pad) * 0.6) 0;

  > .wrap {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 25px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 2.4vw, 32px);
    margin: 0;

    @include mobile {
      font-size: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
  }

  .hand {
    font-size: 23px;
    transform: rotate(-4deg);
  }

  .links {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    justify-items: center;
  }

  .sub-link {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--green);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }

  @include mobile {
    > .wrap {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 23px;
    }

    .hand {
      display: none;
    }

    .links {
      width: 100%;
      justify-items: start;
    }

    .button {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
}
</style>
